    <div id="keyboard-shortcuts">
        <b>Keyboard Shortcuts</b><br><br>
        - Tab: Navigate through cards<br>
        - J: Place card<br>
        - F: Raise challenge<br>
        - ;: Pass<br>
        - H: Say selected cards<br>
        - S: Focus on first card<br>
        - L: Focus on last card<br>
        - G: Say last game<br>
        - A: Say all cards as sets<br>
        - Backspace: Instant message entry<br>
        - F2: Say all keyboard shortcuts<br>
        - Press & hold 'D': Record voice<br>
        - Release 'D': Stop recording<br>
        - V: Send voice<br>
        - E: Pause/Play voice<br>
        - O: Play latest voice<br>
        - Y: Play previous audio<br>
        - U: Play next audio<br>
        - Press & hold 'W': Start echo test<br>
        - Release 'W': Stop echo test<br>
        - X: Exit room<br>
        - N: Exit game<br>
    </div><br>

    <div id="keyboard-shortcuts-for-screen-readers">
        <b>Keyboard Shortcuts for Screen Readers</b><br><br>
        - NVDA: Insert + Space<br>
        - JAWS: Insert + Z<br>
        - ORCA: Insert + Z<br>
        - VoiceOver: Control + Option + Shift + U<br>
    </div>

